    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d127">

                <pb facs="0257" n="145" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/2127</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-15T21:00:00+09:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1918, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is true that Baron Sakatani is going to China on March 19 to study financial
                    conditions. He called upon me to explain the object of his visit, expressed fear
                    that China faced bankruptcy, feared Chinese officials would not cooperate
                    heartily, had no definite plan to suggest, and would give me benefit of his
                    conclusions on his return.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
